### JSON_PARSE_ERROR：型別不符（數量給了字串）
POST {{ReportPipelineApi_HostAddress}}/api/reports/raw
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reportId": "R901", "quantityOK": "abc"}

### JSON_NULL_PAYLOAD
POST {{ReportPipelineApi_HostAddress}}/api/reports/raw
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

null

### DUPLICATE_KEY：同一個 reportId 送兩次（第二次才會撞）
POST {{ReportPipelineApi_HostAddress}}/api/reports/raw
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reportId": "R902"}

### 正常資料
POST {{ReportPipelineApi_HostAddress}}/api/reports/raw
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reportId": "R1002",
  "workOrderNo": "WO-01",
  "itemCode": "ITEM-1",
  "machineId": "M01",
  "operatorId": "OP01",
  "reportTime": "2026-10-05 10:00:00",
  "quantityOK": 10,
  "quantityNG": 0,
  "ngCode": null,
  "shift": "A"
}

### 缺 ReportId
POST {{ReportPipelineApi_HostAddress}}/api/reports/raw
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workOrderNo": "WO-01",
  "itemCode": "ITEM-1",
  "machineId": "M01",
  "operatorId": "OP01",
  "reportTime": "2026-10-05 10:00:00",
  "quantityOK": 10,
  "quantityNG": 0,
  "shift": "A"
}

### 重複：和第一筆同一個 reportId
POST {{ReportPipelineApi_HostAddress}}/api/reports/raw
X-API-Key: {{ApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reportId": "R1002"}